@startuml
title Step 1 - Build the B2C Catalogue start screen

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "PartyInteractionManagement" as PIM
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM
participant "ProductRecommendationManagement" as PRM

activate EM

EM -> PIM : 1 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/1/taskFlow/1\nSessionId, nextAction: Browse B2C Catalogue
activate PIM
PIM --> EM : 2 **TMF701** 200 OK\nProcessId1, TaskId1, task information required,\navailable actions: Disconnect, Start Order, Browse B2C Catalogue, Read News
deactivate PIM

group Retrieve productCategory
    EM -> PCM : 3 **TMF620 Product Catalog Mgt** GET /productCategory
    activate PCM
    PCM --> EM : 4 **TMF620** 200 OK\nlist of productCategory
    deactivate PCM
end

group Query Intelligence Management for 'best offers'
    EM -> PRM : 5 **TMF680 Recommendation Mgt** POST /queryProductRecommendation\n(with filter criteria)
    activate PRM
    PRM --> EM : 6 **TMF680** 200 OK\nlist of productCategory/productOffering\nNo resource created
    deactivate PRM
end

EM -> EM : 7 display category & 'best offers'
deactivate EM

@enduml
